{"id":"wb-5-455","name":"白佛山石窟造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白佛山","text":"白佛山，又称白虎山、危山、金螺山，位于山东东平境内。海拔370米。\n白佛山景区内有三教寺、石窟造像群，及隋唐宋元明历代石刻等。其中白佛山石窟造像为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1","revisionId":92194739,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92194739","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c4273facd437f318e6b02ae4.jpg","title":"白佛山大佛.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%99%BD%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%9B.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/%E7%99%BD%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%9B.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"孟琛","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​白佛山大佛","width":320,"height":240}}